command-description-plant-spawn =
    Spawns a hydroponics tray at each piped position or entity and plants the specified seed, returning the plant.

command-description-plant-age =
    Advances each piped plant by the specified number of growth ticks.

command-description-plant-ageuntilready =
    Advances each piped plant until it is ready to harvest.

command-description-plant-addmutation =
    Adds the named mutation from a mutation table to the piped plant entities.
